  "bio": "Jens Feller is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Malters, Switzerland, whose expertise in Anime, Fineline, Lettering, and Watercolor styles makes them a versatile choice for a range of tattoo designs. As an allrounder tattoo artist, Jens also does most other styles like Geometric, Black & Gray and many more. Working in his own studio he co-founded with Stoeph Streckeisen, Jens upholds the utmost standards of professionalism, ensuring that every client receives a top-quality experience from concept to completed ink.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Malters, Lucerne, Switzerland"
